<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#ff6500"><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"><title>Classic Mart App</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"></head><body><main class="container" style="padding:24px 16px 100px;max-width:760px"><section style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px"><img src="/assets/pwa-icon.svg" width="64" height="64" alt="Classic Mart"><div><span class="eyebrow">Installable app</span><h1 style="margin:4px 0">Classic Mart</h1><p style="margin:0">The same secure marketplace, optimized for an installed mobile experience.</p></div></section><section class="panel" style="border-radius:22px;padding:20px"><h2>Connected to the live platform</h2><p>Prices, stock, carts, orders and payment state are always read from the server. Offline mode never invents a successful payment or trusted stock level.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="primary-button" href="/">Shop now</a><a class="outline-button" href="/dashboard">My account</a><button class="outline-button" data-pwa-install type="button" hidden>Install app</button></div></section><section class="panel" style="border-radius:22px;padding:20px;margin-top:16px"><h2>Mobile API</h2><p>Approved native or cross-platform clients can authenticate against <code>/api/v1/mobile</code> using rotating opaque access/refresh tokens. Browser sessions remain cookie-based.</p><a class="outline-button" href="/openapi-v1.json">API contract</a></section></main><script src="/pwa.js"></script></body></html>
